config SECURITY_CYDA
	bool "CYDA OS capability enforcement"
	depends on SECURITY && CYDA
	default y
	help
	  Enforces the capability bitmap of CYDA agents at the syscall
	  boundary: network connects, camera/GPU device access, cgroup
	  writes and scheduler changes are refused for agent threads that
	  lack the corresponding capability. Stacks with other LSMs.
